  "description": "The umbrella package for the X-Ray family of .NET libraries. Carries no code of its own: installing it brings in every X-Ray package, for content extraction (X-Ray.Content), rendering office documents to PDF and images (X-Ray.Office), and reading Photoshop (X-Ray.Psd), email (X-Ray.Email), iCalendar (X-Ray.Ics), PostScript and XPS (X-Ray.PS) and OneNote (X-Ray.OneNote) files. Install a single member directly if you only need one.",
